ill catching up to the artists, and artists are still waiting for the listeners. His advice to a younger songwriter is plain: get on Nostr, put the music on RSS, and make it easy for someone to send sats. Save what arrives. That is low time preference. It means choosing the work that lasts over the post that has to perform this week.\nSound money is the other half. Inflation makes a real album more expensive while streaming pays less. AI makes a cheap song easy. Joe's answer is the human one. A machine has not lived the life the song comes from. People still want to stand in a room and hear it.\nThe full video is already free on YouTube: https://youtu.be/MXUgrViBCaI This copy on Fanfares is how a listener pays the people who made it. 21 sats unlocks the audio. 11 sats go to Bitcoin For The Arts and 10 sats go to Joe Martin.\nFind Joe Martin: Website https://www.joemartinmusic.com Merch for sats https://tinyurl.com/joemartinmusic Nostr npub19r9qrxmckj2vyk5a5ttyt966s5qu06vmzyczuh97wj8wtyluktxqymeukr Lightning joe@nostrich.org US vinyl: Grimey's in Nashville. Shipping a record from the Isle of Man costs more than the record. Listen where you can send sats back: Fountain and Wavlake.\nBitcoin For The Arts is a 501(c)(3) that pays artist grants in bitcoin. https://www.bitcoinforthearts.org\n⚡Zap 21 sats to unlock this note on\nhttps://fanfares.io/naddr/naddr1qvzqqqr6dgpzpg88x557qj6fwzsct6ryhz086ms769y0muyrsx65ptqzpf6zcck4qyvhwumn8ghj7enpdenxzun9wvhxummnw3erztnrdaksqfpcxqmnjdtzxfsj6vrrxfjz6drr8yej6c34xscj6e3kx43k2errvvexxd3nxc4a64","created_at":1793155105,"id":"31a029c96851328d7763d2d30e5031154c9913030963702ef844480e48a87365","kind":31338,"pubkey":"a0e73529e04b4970a185e864b89e7d6e1ed148fdf08381b540ac020a742c62d5","sig":"cac96dfe135f570cd96b3926e127de572c7226ba828847610f1b81aa1af1f0af7554f25c23d8d6038129d96577a5f3f9b474c3b87446619df9a8b77ab74cc1b5","tags":[["d","80795b2a-0c2d-4c93-b541-f65cedcc2c63"],["price","21","SATS"],["title","Joe Martin: It's All About the Song"],["s